# Machine-specific packages. Copy to Brewfile.local (which git ignores)
# and adjust per Mac.
#
# Put anything here that is not worth its cost on every machine. On Intel
# Macs Homebrew no longer builds bottles, so a formula whose dependencies
# have moved past the last bottle gets compiled locally - wget alone pulls
# in the whole OpenSSL chain, which is a long build on older hardware.
# macOS ships curl, so wget is a convenience, not a necessity.

brew 'wget'
